 "Figura a <b>{p} cm</b>, distanza focale 10 cm: a che distanza va lo schermo? [[1/q = 1/f − 1/p]]": "Picture at <b>{p} cm</b>, focal length 10 cm: at what distance does the screen go? [[1/q = 1/f − 1/p]]",
